<title>CANADA: Canada Dec natural gas sales rise 1.7 percent.</title>
<headline>Canada Dec natural gas sales rise 1.7 percent.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian sales of natural gas rose 1.7 percent in December from the same month a year earlier, to 7,829,315,000 cubic metres, Statistics Canada said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Thousands of cubic meters and percentage changes:</p>
<p>					Dec 96	Dec 95	Pct</p>
<p> Total			     7,829,315    7,697,355   +1.7</p>
<p> Residential sales	     2,479,770    2,471,924   +0.3</p>
<p> Commercial sales		1,754,502    1,745,955   +0.5</p>
<p> Industrial			2,336,431    2,328,339    n/a</p>
<p> Direct sales		    1,258,612    1,151,137    n/a</p>
<p>(For more information from Statistics Canada, contact Gary Smalldridge, Energy Section, at 613-951-3567)</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613 235-6745))</p>
